# Hot-path translation units of this module, one path per line (relative to src/).
#
# C4a/C4b note: `consensus_module_agent.cpp`, `session_manager.cpp`,
# `cluster_session.cpp`, `log_publisher.cpp` and `egress_publisher.cpp` are
# deliberately not registered yet. Their steady-state paths are allocation-free
# (`append_message` is a two-vector offerv), but the same translation units hold
# the startup/error/session-establishment paths (std::string error descriptions,
# std::filesystem in the mark-file link, session counters/publications), so the
# objects reference `operator new`. Registration waits for the C4/C6 split (or
# the C10 allocation test) that can tell warm-up from steady state, as the
# client module does for egress_poller.
#
# During a poll with back-pressure the ingress adapter ABORTs; the log/egress
# writers are the ones the C10 benchmark will pin.
